{"id":"33d0ef62a50d6129","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-model-number-upper-bound.md","title":"General Upper Bound on the Number of Models","display":"thm-model-number-upper-bound — General Upper Bound on the Number of Models","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-model-number-upper-bound","aliases":["17-thm-model-number-upper-bound"],"display":"thm-model-number-upper-bound — General Upper Bound on the Number of Models","depends_on":["[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-omega-stability]]","[[17-df-isomorphism]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-8.3.3b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-model-number-upper-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-model-number-upper-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-model-number-upper-bound — General Upper Bound on the Number of Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-8.3.3b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 是结构的集合，不是全部模型的真类。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> (language symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,|\\cdot|,\\aleph_0,\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,|\\cdot|,\\aleph_0,\\mathcal P\\)</span> (cardinality and powerset notions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\neq\\mathfrak N\n\\to\n\\mathfrak M\\not\\cong\\mathfrak N\n\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n|\\mathcal R|\\leq|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathcal R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\neq\\mathfrak N\n\\to\n\\mathfrak M\\not\\cong\\mathfrak N\n\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n|\\mathcal R|\\leq|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> is a set of pairwise nonisomorphic representatives. Coding structures on a carrier of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> gives the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa=|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|\">\\(2^\\kappa=|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|\\)</span> upper bound.</li>\n<li>The former claim that the number of models must be only <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>, or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa\">\\(2^\\kappa\\)</span> is false in general.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt"